    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "fl_battlefield",
        "LocalizationKey": "Forest_Lore_Battlefield_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "Heather and thin grass over a field where a battle was fought before anyone now living came here. Bones lie in the roots, and here and there something green and pitted shows through the turf: blades and fittings gone to verdigris. Most of it was picked over long ago. What is left is a few handfuls of ground, and once those are turned the field is only a quiet field."
    },
